{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Held captive by the abandoned Signal Creek Shopping Mall, Nour and her companions must come to terms with their deepest regrets or lose themselves to the Void.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505460/extras/81b5f94c90baac4b13b16694d61bdce7.webp?t=1760061970\" width=475 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Signal Creek is a dialogue-driven RPG set in the surreal pixel art world of a sentient abandoned shopping mall. Playing as college student Nour, you and your companions Nick and Ms. Gaw embark on a journey of reconciliation with the past while searching for a way to escape the mall.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a surreal abandoned mall</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped with your younger brother's best friend and your professional mentor in a place that\u2019s right out of your strangest dreams! Search the top floor of the mall to find objects and interact with characters that may hold the secrets to your escape. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reconcile with the past</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your deepest regrets have somehow materialized in an alternate reality\u00a0\u2014 Nick must face his growing pains, Ms. Gaw has unsettled business from law school, and your estranged friend is back to haunt you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find the missing apple prince...?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover three old (or new?) spaces that house a colorful cast of NPCs! What kind of mall trip would it be without a glitchy uwu-tastic store manager, a troupe of talking (regal) apples, and some guy named Tim wearing shoes on his hands?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505460/extras/81b5f94c90baac4b13b16694d61bdce7.webp?t=1760061970\" width=475 height=60 /></span